{
  "$comment": "What qeetrix-ios is built from. Edit a pin, then run Scripts/sync-upstream.sh: it fetches these exact artifacts, proves the native fonts are the files the web ships, and rewrites upstream.lock.json. Nothing else in Upstream/ is edited by hand. Paths are relative to the repository root. Each licence is the reviewed licence of what is taken — an SPDX expression, or UNLICENSED as @qeetrix/ui publishes it — and goes into the release SBOM (qeetrix-gen sbom).",
